{"4729960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orbit Breaker", "steam_appid": 4729960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbit Breaker is a top-down survival action game about geometric cores, automatic weapons, and build-defining evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is automatic, but survival is not. You move, dodge, position yourself, collect XP and gold, and choose upgrades while enemies close in. Each core starts with a signature weapon and grows in a different direction. Match weapons with the right passives to evolve them into stronger forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are more than empty arenas. Move through connected sectors, uncover hidden unlocks, fight room wardens and timed pressure waves, then defeat the final boss to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feeds the next one. Spend gold on permanent powerups, unlock new cores, weapons, passives, and stages, then return with a sharper build plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>## Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Geometric cores with signature starting weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Automatic attacks built around movement, dodging, and positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapon and passive pairs that evolve into stronger equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sector-based stages with hidden rewards, wardens, miniboss pressure, and final bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Permanent gold powerups and expandable equipment slots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four save slots, run history, and weapon damage reports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multilingual UI including Korean and English</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbit Breaker is a top-down survival action game about geometric cores, automatic weapons, and build-defining evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is automatic, but survival is not. You move, dodge, position yourself, collect XP and gold, and choose upgrades while enemies close in. Each core starts with a signature weapon and grows in a different direction. Match weapons with the right passives to evolve them into stronger forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are more than empty arenas. Move through connected sectors, uncover hidden unlocks, fight room wardens and timed pressure waves, then defeat the final boss to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feeds the next one. Spend gold on permanent powerups, unlock new cores, weapons, passives, and stages, then return with a sharper build plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>## Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Geometric cores with signature starting weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Automatic attacks built around movement, dodging, and positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapon and passive pairs that evolve into stronger equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sector-based stages with hidden rewards, wardens, miniboss pressure, and final bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Permanent gold powerups and expandable equipment slots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four save slots, run history, and weapon damage reports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multilingual UI including Korean and English</p>", "short_description": "Choose a geometric core, survive escalating waves with automatic weapons, and evolve matching weapons and passives into stronger builds. Explore sectors, find unlocks, and defeat the boss.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729960/042e37db3fc75336265f23b2266471744ce25228/header.jpg?t=1781241580", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste